    12	Workloads (rows = seat rows; lead shape [envs, 2]):
    13	  A rollout sampling  : model.forward (sample + values), 256 rows, no_grad
    14	  B PPO train step    : evaluate_actions on 1,024 rows with saved actions,
    15	                        clipped-ratio + value + entropy loss, backward,
    16	                        clip_grad_norm_(10), Muon step (create_optimizer)
    17	  C teacher precompute: evaluate_actions under no_grad on 16,384 rows (proxy:
